.TH tuuniq 1 0.29.0 tclutils "Tcl Utility Command"
.SH NAME
tuuniq \- thin CLI wrapper for tclutils::tuuniq
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
tuuniq ?\-count 0|1? file
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The tuuniq command is a thin wrapper around the Tcl package tclutils::tuuniq. It is intended for interactive and scripting use when tclutils is installed from source. The primary API remains the Tcl library; see tuuniq(n) for procedures, options, and semantics.
.PP
Run the script with tclsh:
.PP
.nf
tclsh bin/tuuniq.tcl ...
.fi

